|gr1= High Command

|descr= Adds icon to a group leader. Returns icon ID, Control icons visibility with [[setGroupIconsVisible]]. Since Arma 3 v2.22 the offset can be set separately for 2d and 3d. 

|pr= The icons will be hidden again after switching to a different unit via [[teamSwitch]]. Execute <sqf inline>setGroupIconsVisible [true, true]; setGroupIconsSelectable true;</sqf> to make them visible again.

|s1= group [[addGroupIcon]] [iconClass, offset]

