{{RV|type=command

|game1= arma3
|version1= 0.74

|gr1= GUI Control - Tree View

|descr= Sets cursor to given item on given path. IDC means id of parent Tree View. To deselect all items use [-1] for the path param (''available since Arma 3 v1.56'')

