{{Note
|user= Dedmen
|timestamp= 20161103040700
|text= With a function only taking one Parameter, it doesn't matter whether the parameter is in an array or not:<br>

Example:
<sqf>
1 call {
	params [["_number",0, [0]]];
};
</sqf>
or
<sqf>
[1] call {
	params [["_number",0, [0]]];
};
</sqf>

But when the one Parameter is an array that parameter has to be inside of an array when the function is called<br>
Example:
<sqf>
[1, 2] call {
	params [["_array", [], [[]], 2]];
}; // Fails

[[1,2]] call {
	params [["_array", [], [[]], 2]];
}; // Succeeds
</sqf>
}}

