|user= POLPOX
|timestamp= 20240127232310
|text= Before circa Arma 3 2.07: The path must '''not''' start with a backslash:
{{{!}}
{{!}} {{Icon|unchecked}}
{{!}} {{hl|"'''\'''a3\armor_f_beta...}}
{{!}}-
{{!}} {{Icon|checked}} 
{{!}} {{hl|"a3\armor_f_beta...}}
{{!}}}
}}

